        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "12.1(c) Each employee, before leaving his or her assigned work on Union business, shall have authorization therefore from the Union and shall notify his or her supervisor prior to taking such leave. The Union shall provide to the designated Company Representative oral confirmation of such authorization at least one (1) day prior to such leave and written confirmation immediately thereafter. Such un-worked time, limited to regular working hours, shall be charged to a special charge account number and the Union agrees to reimburse the Company at the employee's regular hourly rate for all such time so spent.",
            "block_bbox": [
                99,
                150,
                706,
                286
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
